# Clean conformance fixture for the native math:ExactPreservationViolated gate
# (BayesianNetwork arm): a math:BayesianNetwork that declares its math:dependencyGraph
# (structurally complete) AND declares logic:preservationKind logic:ExactPreservation
# directly on itself. It MUST raise NO probability failure class — a complete model
# declaring exactness overclaims nothing. Positive counterpart of
# counter-examples/bayesian-network-exact-preservation-violated.ttl.
@prefix math:  <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:completeExactNetwork a math:BayesianNetwork ;
    math:dependencyGraph ex:networkDag ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:ExactPreservation .

ex:networkDag a math:MathematicalObject .
